    "sub_name": "數位整合行銷實戰分析",
    "sub_ename": "IMPLEMENT ANALYSIS OF DIGITAL INTEGRATED MAKETING",
    "describe_ch": "整合數位行銷觀念並且學習透過品牌現況分析研擬行銷策略\n依據品牌實際預算去執行行銷工具應用與曝光，學習行銷執行後的數據分析與檢討，之後導入實際的品牌案例實作，與業界接軌。\n",
    "describe_eh": "Integrate digital marketing concepts and learn to develop marketing strategies through brand status analysis\nImplement marketing tool application and exposure based on the actual budget of the brand, learn the data analysis and review after marketing actual operation, and then import actual brand case implementations to convergence with the industry.\n",
