    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "本課程大多討論與教學目前業界數位行銷做法與技巧，請同學上課認真學習，作業按時繳交 ，勇於發問，遵守上課禮儀\nThis course mostly discusses and teaches the current digital marketing practices and techniques in the industry. Students are asked to study carefully in class, submit assignments on time, be brave enough to ask questions, and abide by class etiquette.",
    "course_pol_en": "This course primarily focuses on discussing and teaching current digital marketing practices and techniques used in the industry. Students are expected to study diligently in class, submit assignments on time, ask questions confidently, and adhere to classroom etiquette.\n\n\n本課程主要探討並教授業界目前所使用的數位行銷實務與技術。學生應在課堂上認真學習，準時繳交作業，勇於提問，並遵守課堂禮儀。",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>課堂中將會介紹許多正在實施數位行銷的廠商與品牌案例，也因此希望同學們不要在課堂外討論或洩漏任何敏感資訊。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>課堂中將會介紹許多正在實施數位行銷的廠商與品牌案例，也因此希望同學們不要在課堂外討論或洩漏任何敏感資訊。</div>\n\n<div><br />\nThe course will include numerous case studies of companies and brands currently engaged in digital marketing. Therefore, students are expected not to discuss or disclose any sensitive information outside the classroom.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
